@baseUrl = http://localhost:7072/api
@functionKey =

### Check extension support before sending destination fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Cross-category alias: the REG-LOCATION anchor must already exist
POST {{baseUrl}}/equivalent-entries
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "registryId": "acme",
    "categoryId": "FunctionalLocation",
    "categorySourceId": "REG-LOCATION",
    "existingIdInSource": "7",
    "existingSourceId": "REG-LOCATION",
    "destinationCategoryId": "ASSET",
    "destinationCategorySourceId": "MMS",
    "entry": {
      "idInSource": "101",
      "sourceId": "MMS",
      "cirid": "01a15da2-874c-7a25-8205-3763f5796e75",
      "name": "WW01"
    }
  }
]

### Legacy same-category behavior: omit both destination fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/equivalent-entries
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "registryId": "acme",
    "categoryId": "FunctionalLocation",
    "categorySourceId": "REG-LOCATION",
    "existingIdInSource": "7",
    "existingSourceId": "REG-LOCATION",
    "entry": { "idInSource": "example-alias", "sourceId": "EXAMPLE" }
  }
]

### Invalid partial destination (HTTP 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/equivalent-entries
x-functions-key: {{functionKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "registryId": "acme",
    "categoryId": "FunctionalLocation",
    "categorySourceId": "REG-LOCATION",
    "existingIdInSource": "7",
    "existingSourceId": "REG-LOCATION",
    "destinationCategoryId": "ASSET",
    "entry": { "idInSource": "101", "sourceId": "MMS" }
  }
]
